<ArticleLayout
  title="Fridge Dimensions Australia: What to Measure Before Buying"
  seoTitle="Fridge Sizes & Dimensions Australia: Width, Depth & Fit"
  description="Compare fridge dimensions in mm and cm, with a model size chart, cavity widths and clearance checks. Measure door swing and delivery access before buying."
  category="Kitchen"
  date="Updated October 2026"
  dateModified="2026-10-31"
